                                                                                
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*   PROGRAM:   W22562                                                  *        
*                                                                      *        
*   FÖRFATT.:  JOHAN LINDKVIST                                         *        
*                                                                      *        
*   FUNKTION:  LISTAR SERVICEGRAD PER BUYER                            *        
*                                                                      *        
*   INPUT:     W231.W231V3.DC62.W23195                                 *        
*                                                                      *        
*   OUTPUT:    LISTA                                                   *        
*                                                                      *        
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
FILE W22562D1                                                                   
%W23195                                                                         
FILE W22562D2 PRINTER VB (125 0)                                                
*                                                                               
SERVGN   W  3 P 1                                                               
SERVGB   W  3 P 1                                                               
*                                                                               
BUYER    W  2  N                                                                
AVBOK    W  7  P 2 MASK (BWZ)                                                   
INKOMM   W  7  P 0 MASK (BWZ)                                                   
FYSAVV   W  7  P 2 MASK (BWZ)                                                   
                                                                                
*    -- CHECKED BY WY2000                                                       
*                                                                               
JOB INPUT W22562D1                                                              
BUYER    = IDPERSON-BUY                                                         
AVBOK    = SUAVBRP                                                              
INKOMM   = SUINKORD                                                             
FYSAVV   = SUFYSAVP                                                             
                                                                                
     PRINT RAPPORT01                                                            
                                                                                
REPORT RAPPORT01  SUMMARY +                                                     
    PRINTER W22562D2 LINESIZE 120 SPACE 4 NOADJUST                              
SEQUENCE BUYER                                                                  
CONTROL BUYER                                                                   
TITLE 1  COL 12 'VOLVO CAR PARTS               W22562-001'                      
TITLE 2  COL 12 'LISTING OF SERVICE PER BUYER   (IN AUSTRALIA)'                 
HEADING BUYER    ('BUYER')                                                      
HEADING SERVGN   ('SERVICE' 'NET')                                              
HEADING SERVGB   ('SERVICE' 'GROSS')                                            
HEADING TALLY    ('NO. OF' 'PARTS')                                             
HEADING INKOMM   ('NO. OF' 'LINES')                                             
HEADING AVBOK    ('   ')                                                        
HEADING FYSAVV   ('   ')                                                        
                                                                                
LINE BUYER SERVGN SERVGB TALLY INKOMM AVBOK FYSAVV                              
                                                                                
BEFORE-BREAK. PROC                                                              
 IF INKOMM > 0                                                                  
    SERVGB ROUNDED = AVBOK * 100 / INKOMM                                       
    SERVGN ROUNDED = (AVBOK - FYSAVV) * 100 / INKOMM                            
 END-IF                                                                         
    AVBOK = 0                                                                   
    FYSAVV = 0                                                                  
END-PROC                                                                        
